---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Nicholas.K | Growth & Partnerships Advisor">
  <Header />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary via-dark to-primary pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-40 md:pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-4">About Me</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold text-white md:text-5xl max-w-3xl">
        I Built It at Spotify. Now I Help You Build Yours.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        I'm Nicholas K — a growth and partnerships advisor with 17 years of hands-on experience building the distribution networks, payment ecosystems, and strategic partnerships that helped scale Spotify globally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 items-start">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">My Story</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              I joined Spotify in March 2009 — when the company was still fighting for traction and paid subscriptions were far from certain. My first role was Head of Premium Subscriptions for the Nordic region, and from that moment on, I was building.
            </p>
            <p>
              Over 17 years, I launched Spotify's first prepaid product in the Nordics, led the global rollout of the gift card business across 13+ markets, negotiated the payment partnerships that enabled Spotify's PAYG ecosystem to scale internationally, and closed strategic deals with banks, major retailers, and financial institutions that opened entirely new acquisition channels for the Premium subscription.
            </p>
            <p>
              I spent years deep in consumer insight research too — leading studies across emerging markets to understand pricing sensitivity, willingness to pay, and user behaviour. That work directly shaped market entry strategies and product decisions at a global scale.
            </p>
            <p>
              Before Spotify, I worked in FMCG and B2B sales with brands including Bacardi and British American Tobacco, where I built Sweden's first national B2B retail incentive programme — doubling sales in the channel.
            </p>
            <p>
              What I've learned across all of it: the businesses that scale fastest aren't always the ones with the best product. They're the ones that build the right ecosystems — the partnerships, distribution infrastructure, and payment models that multiply reach and compound over time. That's what I now help other businesses design and execute.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 p-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-4">Core Expertise</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Strategic partnership design & negotiation</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Go-to-market strategy & channel development</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Revenue growth frameworks & KPI systems</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Ecosystem mapping & partner scoring</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Business development & sales enablement</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="mt-1 h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-secondary flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Workshop facilitation & team alignment</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 p-8">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-4">My Approach</h3>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
              <p><strong class="text-gray-700">Listen first.</strong> Every business is different. I start by deeply understanding your goals, market, and current position.</p>
              <p><strong class="text-gray-700">Think strategically.</strong> I map the landscape, identify high-value opportunities, and prioritise ruthlessly.</p>
              <p><strong class="text-gray-700">Execute practically.</strong> Strategy without action is just a document. I help you move from insight to implementation.</p>
              <p><strong class="text-gray-700">Measure relentlessly.</strong> If we can't measure it, we can't improve it. Every initiative gets clear KPIs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-primary md:text-4xl">Values I Work By</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Integrity</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Honest advice, always. I only recommend what I genuinely believe will drive results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent/10 text-accent">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Impact</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Every engagement is focused on measurable outcomes that matter to your bottom line.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Collaboration</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">I work as an extension of your team — aligned, transparent, and invested in your success.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="mx-auto mb-4 inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/10 text-secondary">
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-heading font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Long-Term Thinking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted">Quick wins matter, but I design for sustainable growth that compounds over time.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-secondary to-primary py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-white">Let's Work Together</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/80 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Ready to explore how partnerships can accelerate your growth? I'd love to hear about your business.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-primary transition-all hover:bg-accent/90 hover:shadow-xl">
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
